  "title": "The call plan is specific to the application",
  "purpose": "Five modules, three with eligibility conditions on application data. Four applications give four plans from one survey: modules IN, OUT (does not apply, or cannot be decided and the survey says skip) or HALTS (cannot be decided and the survey says stop). What an answer will decide stays OPEN in every plan, with its alternatives. Each run delivers exactly what its plan settled.",
